{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-12/1059508/block/singleImage/3244268/df/e624f013-55e5-4bb9-8f51-81d9de0f60c6.jpeg?updatedAt=1792559961\"/><figcaption>天水圍七旬婦墮樓，當場不治。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (21 日 ) 上午 8 時 07 分，警方接獲保安報案，發現一名老婦倒臥在天水圍天靖街 3 號對開。 人員接報到場，發現該名 78 歲姓徐老婦倒臥上址對開，她現場被證實死亡。經初步調查，相信事主從上址住所墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T06:20:47.491317+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:19:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T08:37:55.667669+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:17:46.993724+00:00","content_hash":"c81662c9c895d03fa3a5749ddab08ee928a3954144166da1a0472b54384ddd12","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}